      "widgets_values": [
        "Pixel art style. Painterly pixel-art environment for a side-view game. Cinder Coast at late afternoon: a wide terracotta sandstone coastline bordering a cool turquoise sea, seen at eye level. A near cliff at the left edge frames the view with rough layered stone and sparse olive shrubs. A curved middle-distance shoreline recedes toward a distant hazy island silhouette on the right. Upper-left sunlight cuts across the irregular shelves, with warm rock highlights, cool violet shadows and softer blue-grey distant land. Use softened organic contours and nuanced, stepped colour ramps. Shape the rock with irregular clustered brushwork, and keep only the focal silhouette edges crisp. Leave a quiet lower quarter for a playable foreground and keep the horizon readable. Full-bleed opaque background, no text, frame, UI, characters, blur, or airbrushed gradients."
      ],
      "title": "Scene prompt",
      "color": "#232",
      "bgcolor": "#353"
